1
00:00:00,552 --> 00:00:02,252
(Sheldon:)I didn't punch him.

2
00:00:02,254 --> 00:00:03,984
(Sheldon:)He turned around,
and I gave him

3
00:00:03,989 --> 00:00:06,189
(Sheldon:)a Captain Kirk karate chop.

4
00:00:06,925 --> 00:00:07,895
(Sheldon:)I'm not even sure

5
00:00:07,893 --> 00:00:09,993
(Sheldon:)he knows I did it.

6
00:00:09,995 --> 00:00:11,695
(Leonard:)Hey, Sheldon,

7
00:00:11,697 --> 00:00:14,027
(Leonard:)I've got someone here who
might make you feel better.

8
00:00:14,032 --> 00:00:15,832
(Stephen Hawking(on skype):)Hello, Sheldon.

9
00:00:15,834 --> 00:00:17,534
Professor Hawking!

10
00:00:17,536 --> 00:00:18,836
(Hawking:)I understand

11
00:00:18,837 --> 00:00:21,537
(Hawking:)you're struggling
with professional jealousy.

12
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:24,710
(Sheldon:)Thanks, Leonard, now he's
not gonna think I'm cool.

13
00:00:25,777 --> 00:00:28,877
(Hawking:)Don't worry,
I know how you feel.

14
00:00:28,881 --> 00:00:31,351
(Hawking:)I have never won a Nobel Prize.

15
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:34,280
(Penny:)Oh, wow, that
doesn't seem fair.

16
00:00:34,286 --> 00:00:35,256
(Leonard:)It's fine.

17
00:00:35,254 --> 00:00:37,224
I've been on The Simpsons.

18
00:00:39,191 --> 00:00:41,961
(Sheldon:)How do you deal with
the success of your colleagues?

19
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:43,330
(Hawking:)I remind myself

20
00:00:43,328 --> 00:00:46,528
(Hawking:)every scientific advancement
is a victory.

21
00:00:46,531 --> 00:00:50,101
Also, I was on Star Trek.

22
00:00:51,536 --> 00:00:54,476
(Leonard:)Oh, it was a good one. He played
poker with Sir Isaac...

23
00:00:54,473 --> 00:00:56,943
(Leonard:)You don't care.

24
00:00:56,942 --> 00:00:58,942
(Hawking:)Don't waste your time
on jealousy,

